      "text": "The notes discuss the Deluge survivor’s Sumerian name (Zi-u-gd-du / Zi-u-su-du) and relate it to long life, stating that Ut-napishtim in the Assyrian version seems to be an abbreviated Akkadian rendering connected to “Day of Life.”",
