      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:3",
      "text": "A cosmology of nine worlds is listed (including realms of gods, Vanir, elves, humans, giants, fire, dark elves, the dead, and an uncertain ninth), and the 'tree' is identified as the world-ash Yggdrasil symbolizing the universe.",
