      "text": "Ithavoll is described as the meeting-place of the gods.",
      "category": "setting",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:8",
      "text": "A game involving 'tables' is discussed; 'giant-maids' are suggested as possibly the three Norns corresponding to the three fates, though loss of text is also suggested; the Norns are elsewhere described as giant-maidens and can be many and of various races.",
      "category": "other",
      "evidence_refs": [
