      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:4",
      "text": "Thor says he traveled east, killed giants and their women who went to the mountain, and implies their survival would have eliminated men in Mithgarth.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:5",
      "text": "Harbarth says he was in Valland raising wars and angering princes; he states that Othin has the noble who fall in fight, while Thor has the race of thralls.",
