      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:8",
      "text": "Harbarth says he met a linen-white maid by stealth, pleased a gold-decked woman, and received joy; he also says he needed Thor's help to hold the white maid fast.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:9",
      "text": "Thor says he slew the brides of the Berserkers in Hlesey, and later describes them as she-wolf-like; he says they shook his trimmed ship, threatened with iron clubs, and drove off Thjalfi.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:10",
      "text": "Harbarth says he was with a host that came there, raising banners and reddening spears.",
