      "text": "In Snorri's version, Thor pulls on a fishing line so hard that his feet go through the boat's floor and he stands on the sea bottom; when Thor pulls the serpent up, Hymir cuts the line with a knife so the serpent escapes; Thor then strikes Hymir overboard with his hammer and wades ashore.",
