      "text": "Bragi says the gods will prepare no place or seat for Loki among them.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:11",
      "text": "Loki reminds Othin that in old days they mixed blood together and that Othin promised no ale should be poured unless brought for them both.",
