    "summary": "Editorial notes discuss stanza/line problems in the manuscript of Rigsthula, gloss personal names and social titles, comment on possible interpolations and lost lines, and connect specific details (feast-straw, rune-magic, crow as mentor, royal-name etymology, and Danish royal genealogy traditions) to other Eddic passages and later sources.",
