      "text": "Groa chants multiple charms in sequence (first through ninth), each specifying a threat (misfortune, purposeless wandering, threatening streams, foes on the gallows-way, fetters, storms at sea, frost on crags, a curse from a Christian woman, and a warlike giant in words) and a promised protection.",
