      "text": "Gripir foretells that Sigurth, Gunnar, and Hogni will take oaths, and that Sigurth and Gunnar will change forms as they go forth; Sigurth will get Gunnar's form and shape while keeping his own mind and voice, and thus win the hand of Heimirs fosterling.",
