      "text": "The note states that Reginsmol follows Gripisspo in the Codex Regius; some stanzas are also quoted in Volsungasaga and Nornageststhattr; and the poem’s title is not explicitly stated in the manuscripts.",
      "category": "other",
      "evidence_refs": [
