      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:6",
      "text": "Brynhild replies that the giantess should not chide her; she says she was once accustomed to battle and claims she will seem better than the giantess when people truly know them.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:7",
      "text": "The giantess identifies Brynhild as Buthli’s daughter and accuses her of causing the death of Gjuki’s children and laying their house low.",
