      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:2",
      "text": "The envoy describes promised gifts including shields, ash-wood shafts, gold-adorned helmets, slaves, silver-gilt saddle-cloths, scarlet shirts, lances, spears, steeds, the field of Gnitaheith, treasures, the home of Danp, and the forest called Myrkwood.",
