      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:5",
      "text": "Gunnar’s comrades and kin are not eager to go; nevertheless, Gunnar speaks as a king in the beer-hall and calls for golden beakers to be brought.",
