      "text": "The notes state that Hjalli is Atli’s cook and is killed to deceive Gunnar, as Atli hopes to obtain the hoard’s secret from Högni if Gunnar remains silent; they add that in Atlamál Hjalli is spared at Högni’s intercession.",
      "category": "sequence",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:7"
      ]
    },
