      "text": "The notes state that a stanza shows blended traditions about the treasure: the German tradition of the gold of the Rhine, the (German) hoard of the Nibelungs (Niflungs), and the northern tradition of the theft of Andvari’s treasure by Óðinn, Hœnir, and Loki.",
