      "text": "Glaumvor recounts dreams to Gunnar: a gallows prepared for him and serpents eating his flesh; a bloody sword and a spear thrust through his body; wolves howling at head and feet; a river running through the hall sweeping benches and affecting the two brothers; dead women coming at night seeking him and summoning him to their benches, with Norns unable to help.",
