      "text": "Glaumvor warns Vingi that his coming may be ill-requited if evil follows; Vingi swears he has not lied and invokes giants and the gallows if he has hostile intent; Bera offers a benediction for happy sailing and victory; Hogni responds that words avail little to lead one homeward.",
