      "id": "obs:2",
      "text": "The notes summarize that Guthrun married Jonak and had sons Hamther and Sorli (with a note that Erp is not one of this marriage); Guthrun is described as daughter of Gjuki, sister of Gunnar and Hogni, and widow of Sigurth and then Atli.",
