      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:4",
      "text": "Feridun summons chief warriors and appoints them to positions; warriors assemble with clubs, scimitars, steeds, and armor; the sacred banner of the blacksmith waves at the front.",
