    "summary": "Sam dreams omens about his exposed son Zal being alive on Mount Alberz; after a second dream reproaching him, Sam climbs the mountain and prays. The Simurgh (Smrgh), who has raised and educated Zal (also named Dustan), returns him to Sam and gives Zal a feather to burn on fire to summon help. Zal is presented to King Minchihr, receives gifts, and is proclaimed by astrologers to have great destiny. Sam is sent to campaign; Zal governs wisely in Zabulistan, studies with learned men, and later travels.",
