      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:9",
      "text": "Astrologers calculate Zal's destiny and proclaim exalted fortune and prodigious might; Minchihr gives Zal horses, armor, gold, garments, and appoints Sam to govern regions including Kabul, Zabul, and Ind.",
