  "canonical_text": {
    "quote": "",
    "summary": "Afrsiyb marches against Nauder with a large army and detaches troops against Zabulistan. A Tranian chief challenges the Persians to single combat; the aged Kobd accepts, is killed, and the battle escalates with heavy losses. Nauder, foreseeing ruin, sends his two sons and household to take refuge on Mount Alberz. After further fighting and Persian defeats, Afrsiyb sends a raiding force to intercept Nauder’s household; Krun rides out at midnight, kills Brmn in single combat, takes his head as a trophy, and defeats the raiders while continuing toward Iran.",
    "language": "English",
    "quote_policy": "summarized"
  },
  "literal_observations": [
