      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:4",
      "text": "The youth surveys the regalia and troops, salutes the chiefs, and begins a march toward Persia; brazen drums resound and the army’s movement shakes the ground; \"blood and havoc\" follow.",
