      "id": "obs:2",
      "text": "King Ks believes it may be impossible to learn the truth from the parties and uses a test: he smells Saiwush's hands and garments (rose-water scent) and Sdveh's garments (wine and musk scent).",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
