      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:6",
      "text": "Intelligence arrives that Afrsiyb has assembled an army to invade Iran; Ks plans to take the field, but Saiwush requests to be employed and mentions success with Rustem's advice; Rustem says the king need not go; the treasury is opened to equip troops; after one month the army marches toward Balkh.",
