      "text": "Ferangs appeals to Afrsiyb for clemency toward Saiwush, arguing Saiwush is guiltless and warning of curses and torments for murderous rule; she names other figures as potential avengers and challengers.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
