      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:4",
      "text": "Prn challenges Gw, citing Gw’s earlier defeat of three hundred soldiers, and Gw replies with threats including taking Prn prisoner alive and foretelling deaths connected to avenging Saiwush.",
