      "text": "Rustem warns that Afrsiyb is expert in multiple combat arts and advises that warriors fight for the king instead.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:4",
      "text": "Kai-khosru says a monarch who does not fight for himself is unworthy of the crown; Rustem weeps tears of blood at this.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:5",
      "text": "Barz grabs the king's stirrup, strikes his own forehead against it, draws a dagger, and threatens to kill himself if the king goes.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:6",
      "text": "Kai-khosru relents and tells Rustem that Barz is descended from Rustem.",
      "category": "relationship",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:7",
      "text": "Barz rides out to face Afrsiyb; Afrsiyb accuses him of ingratitude and unknown parentage and calls him demon-born.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:8",
      "text": "Barz says he previously served Afrsiyb because he ate his salt, but now owes allegiance to Kai-khosru because he eats the king's salt.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:9",
      "text": "Afrsiyb shoots a dart/arrow that pierces Barz's armor and wounds his side; Afrsiyb exults at seeing blood.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:10",
      "text": "After exchanges of weapons (battle-axe, bow and arrows, shield, mace), Afrsiyb empties his quiver and prepares to use his mace.",
      "category": "sequence",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:11",
      "text": "Hmn advises Afrsiyb not to risk himself against Barz and says Kai-khosru is the proper adversary; Prn and Hmn urge a general attack.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:12",
      "text": "Trnians surround Barz and inflict many severe wounds; Rustem and Fermurz rush to support him and kill many enemies; a large battle follows.",
      "category": "action",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:13",
      "text": "Kai-khosru comes to assist Barz; the Trnians flee; Afrsiyb escapes in the confusion; Rustem advises against pursuit.",
