    "summary": "Gushtsp secretly performs dangerous trials—killing a monstrous wolf in a wilderness and a fire-breathing dragon on a mountain—so that Mabrn and Ahrun can satisfy the king of Rm’s conditions and receive royal brides. Proof of the dragon’s death is provided by its extracted fangs. After Gushtsp’s wife inadvertently reveals his role, the king honors Gushtsp and appoints him commander of the army.",
