  "canonical_text": {
    "quote": "",
    "summary": "Isfendiyr defeats enemy forces, captures the demon-race gladiator Kurugsar with a noose, and drives Arjsp to flee; the enemy survivors beg for quarter with a straw-in-mouth gesture. After celebration at Balkh, Gushtsp offers to yield the throne but Isfendiyr refuses, focusing instead on rescuing his captive sisters and avenging Arjsp. Kurugsar pleads for life; Gushtsp accepts an oath of loyalty, frees him, and treats him with wine, instructing him to obey Isfendiyr, who then houses him to test his promised fidelity.",
    "language": "English",
    "quote_policy": "summarized"
  },
