      "text": "A note explains that the word \"Gurz\" can mean a wild boar, but orthodox readers do not suppose that meaning in the text; it comments on the warrior name corresponding with the standard’s bearings and discusses heraldry/family arms in multiple cultures, including a report about Japanese family arms on clothing and cloaks given as honor.",
