      "text": "A note says the original term is \"Umud\", apparently a weapon made of iron; \"Umud\" also signifies a column or beam.",
      "category": "object",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:11",
      "text": "A note quotes/relates Sa'di: Zl tells Rustem never to calculate upon the weakness or insignificance of an enemy.",
